- Plastic figures: \(2 \text{ days} \times 5 \text{ figures/day} = 10\) figures
- Total figures: \(8 + 10 = 18\)

Total spending is \(7 \text{ days} \times 10 \text{ dollars/day} = 70\) dollars, which uses all his money.

Thus, by the end of the week, Peter will have bought a total of 18 action figures.

